{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":497192,"name":"Neto Hog","username":"nhog","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/n/ecd19e/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-21T17:03:29.243Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497192-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497192-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497192-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497192-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot unavailable; stuck up “Updating Grok Bot’s Computer” dialog on Transferring your data phase at 43%. Been stuck here most of the day, unable to use anything while the update is running.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497192-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497192-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBug is prominent, prevents usage and is persistent on all opens and restarts.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497192-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497192-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot finishes or fails the update\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497192-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497192-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/d/b/dbe8e4e17f816dc4ed5c2ca7c4ed8334d244b8dd.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/vnpxqVvjRjhEweHGVMlFhPyFuOh.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-21 at 2.01.49 PM.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/d/b/dbe8e4e17f816dc4ed5c2ca7c4ed8334d244b8dd.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-21 at 2.01.49 PM.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"vnpxqVvjRjhEweHGVMlFhPyFuOh\" width=\"690\" height=\"490\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F6F6\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eScreenshot 2026-09-21 at 2.01.49 PM.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1016×722 21.8 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497192-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497192-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497192-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497192-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot Mac app\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497192-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497192-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":11,"updated_at":"2026-09-21T17:03:38.415Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":21,"reads":15,"readers_count":14,"score":108.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":172535,"topic_slug":"grokbot-unavailable-hung-on-updating-grok-bot-s-computer-at-43","display_username":"Neto Hog","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":79209,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grokbot-unavailable-hung-on-updating-grok-bot-s-computer-at-43/172535/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true,"can_vote":false},{"id":497266,"name":"Kevin Neilson","username":"kevinn","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/kevinn/{size}/101206_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-21T18:08:49.588Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/nhog\"\u003e@nhog\u003c/a\u003e thanks for the report, and sorry about this.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat you saw is the automatic update of your Grok Bot’s computer. It builds a fresh computer and copies your data over, and that copy step has been getting stuck for some people over the last couple of days. Your existing computer, bots and files are untouched while it runs, so nothing was lost.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn our side the update for your account gave up at about 2:22 PM your time (roughly 20 minutes after your screenshot), the dialog should have cleared, and your bots should be back on the computer you had before. The team has since rolled out a change for the stuck copy step, so a future update should go through normally.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTwo things worth knowing:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlease don’t press Reset if it happens again. It isn’t needed and it wipes the computer. Giving the update about an hour to finish or give up on its own is the safe move.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe Grok Bot mobile app keeps working during an update, since only the desktop is covered by that dialog.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCould you confirm your bots are responding again? If the dialog comes back or a bot is still stuck, reply here and I’ll take another look.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":11,"updated_at":"2026-09-21T18:08:49.588Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":11,"readers_count":10,"score":22.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":172535,"topic_slug":"grokbot-unavailable-hung-on-updating-grok-bot-s-computer-at-43","display_username":"Kevin Neilson","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":105146,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grokbot-unavailable-hung-on-updating-grok-bot-s-computer-at-43/172535/6","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":true,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":498645,"name":"Raymond Bell","username":"Raymond_Bell","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/278d